# Round 2, group A: Text, translations, wording, CSV exports (96 bugs)

Every bug below must end VERIFIED. Full details are in `qa/bug-register.md`.

- [ ] ETQAN-QA-770 (P2, M16): Home page never shows live courses, packages or teachers: the admin switches "إظهار الدورات / الباقات / المعلمين" do nothing
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-053 (P3, M02): Opening an email-verification link a second time says "invalid or expired" although the address is verified
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-055 (P3, M02): A used reset link still shows the new-password form; the error appears only after submitting and offers no "request a new link" action
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-059 (P3, M02): When the session has ended, saving shows the raw "لم يتم تزويد بيانات الدخول." and the page still looks signed in
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-066 (P3, M02): Arabic sign-in page says "جديد على إتقان؟" (New to Etqan?) on an academy's white-label login; English and Spanish say "New here?"
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-102 (P3, M03): Notification texts mix Latin names, amounts and ISO dates into Arabic without isolation ("لـSCN Student B1" shows as "SCN Student B1J", date "26-10-2026.", raw "1,500.00 EGP"), title and body aligned differently
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-106 (P3, M03): Opening a record that doesn't exist: the student page spins forever; the invoice page retries the 404 four times before "couldn't be found"
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-115 (P3, M03): The parent's menu and pages speak as if the parent were the student ("My learning", "My progress", "My homework", "My certificates"; AR "تعلّمي", "تقدّمي", "واجباتي", "شهاداتي")
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-154 (P3, M04): Person form time-zone picker is a raw list of 419 English IANA ids (UTC, Africa/Abidjan…, old ids like Africa/Asmera) in the Arabic UI
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-159 (P3, M04): A deactivated student without login looks exactly like an active one: list and Account card both say "بلا تسجيل دخول"
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-161 (P3, M04): Students CSV exported from the Arabic UI has English headers and raw English codes (`invited`, `no_login`, `paused`, `female`, `individual`)
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-164 (P3, M04): "تعديل العائلة" shows the required payer as empty "—" although the family has a payer
- [ ] ETQAN-QA-166 (P3, M04): Students of a retired family still show "عائلي" and the family chip with no "retired" mark
